Package: thalmle
Type: Package
Title: Experimental Targeted HAL-MLE for a Continuous-Dose Dose-Response Curve
Version: 0.0.2
Authors@R: person("Pedro", "Sordo Martínez", email = "amurlaniakea@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Experimental, unofficial implementation of the targeting step of the
    Targeted HAL-MLE of Rodriguez, Diaz-Ordaz, Lehmann and van der Laan
    (arXiv:2607.03824) for a continuous-dose dose-response curve. Point
    estimates only; not validated against the preprint.
License: AGPL (>= 3)
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports: glmnet, stats
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0), hal9001, haldensify
Config/testthat/edition: 3
